id: feline-warrior
name: Feline Warrior
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Neko Majin
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Unlike your magic-focused kin, you use your keenly honed feline senses and lightning reflexes to aid you in direct combat.
